// Radio preset: 1984 SoCal. Real, listener-supported internet stations whose stream URLs
// their broadcasters publish for listening (SomaFM's .pls playlists, Radio Paradise's
// stream links); names are the services' own channel names. Nothing is rehosted.
// tools/check-streams.mjs answered audio for every URL on the date in `terms_checked`;
// `verified` turns true after the owner's first listen. Format: crates/audio/src/station.rs,
// docs/AUDIO_RADIO.md.
